  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-reading-language-prereferences</b></p><a name=\"ahip-reading-language-prereferences\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-reading-language-prereferences\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://tools.ietf.org/html/bcp47</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>amh</td><td>Amharic</td></tr><tr><td>ara</td><td>Arabic</td></tr><tr><td>ath</td><td>Athabaskan (Na-Deme)</td></tr><tr><td>ben</td><td>Bengali</td></tr><tr><td>bur</td><td>Burmese</td></tr><tr><td>yue</td><td>Chinese (Simplified)</td></tr><tr><td>cha</td><td>Chamorro</td></tr><tr><td>chk</td><td>Chuukese</td></tr><tr><td>cro</td><td>Crow</td></tr><tr><td>dak</td><td>Dakota</td></tr><tr><td>dan</td><td>Danish</td></tr><tr><td>prs</td><td>Dari</td></tr><tr><td>dut</td><td>Dutch</td></tr><tr><td>eng</td><td>English</td></tr><tr><td>far</td><td>Farsi</td></tr><tr><td>fij</td><td>Fijian</td></tr><tr><td>fre</td><td>French</td></tr><tr><td>ger</td><td>German</td></tr><tr><td>gre</td><td>Greek</td></tr><tr><td>hat</td><td>Haitian Creole</td></tr><tr><td>haw</td><td>Hawaiian</td></tr><tr><td>heb</td><td>Hebrew</td></tr><tr><td>hin</td><td>Hindi</td></tr><tr><td>hmn</td><td>Hmong</td></tr><tr><td>ind</td><td>Indonesian</td></tr><tr><td>ipk</td><td>Inupiaq</td></tr><tr><td>ita</td><td>Italian</td></tr><tr><td>jpn</td><td>Japanese</td></tr><tr><td>kar</td><td>Karen</td></tr><tr><td>kkh</td><td>Karenni</td></tr><tr><td>khm</td><td>Central Khmer</td></tr><tr><td>kor</td><td>Korean</td></tr><tr><td>kos</td><td>Kosraean</td></tr><tr><td>kur</td><td>Kurdish</td></tr><tr><td>lkt</td><td>Lakota (sioux)</td></tr><tr><td>lao</td><td>Lao</td></tr><tr><td>lit</td><td>Lithuanian</td></tr><tr><td>cmn</td><td>Chinese (Traditional)</td></tr><tr><td>mah</td><td>Marshallese</td></tr><tr><td>mus</td><td>Muscogee</td></tr><tr><td>nav</td><td>Navajo (Dine')</td></tr><tr><td>nep</td><td>Nepali</td></tr><tr><td>nor</td><td>Norwegian</td></tr><tr><td>oji</td><td>Ojibwe</td></tr><tr><td>ood</td><td>O'oodham</td></tr><tr><td>pdc</td><td>Pennsylvania Dutch (Pennsylvania German)</td></tr><tr><td>pau</td><td>Palauan</td></tr><tr><td>pus</td><td>Pashto</td></tr><tr><td>per</td><td>Persian</td></tr><tr><td>pol</td><td>Polish</td></tr><tr><td>pon</td><td>Pohnpeian</td></tr><tr><td>por</td><td>Portuguese</td></tr><tr><td>rus</td><td>Russian</td></tr><tr><td>smo</td><td>Samoan</td></tr><tr><td>sin</td><td>Sinhala</td></tr><tr><td>som</td><td>Somali</td></tr><tr><td>spa</td><td>Spanish</td></tr><tr><td>swa</td><td>Swahili</td></tr><tr><td>swe</td><td>Swedish</td></tr><tr><td>tgl</td><td>Tagalog</td></tr><tr><td>tam</td><td>Tamil</td></tr><tr><td>tha</td><td>Thai</td></tr><tr><td>ton</td><td>Tongan</td></tr><tr><td>tli</td><td>Tlingit</td></tr><tr><td>tpi</td><td>Tok Pisin</td></tr><tr><td>ukr</td><td>Ukrainian</td></tr><tr><td>urd</td><td>Urdu</td></tr><tr><td>vie</td><td>Vietnamese</td></tr><tr><td>wel</td><td>Welsh</td></tr><tr><td>apw</td><td>Western Apache</td></tr><tr><td>yap</td><td>Yapese</td></tr><tr><td>yid</td><td>Yiddish</td></tr><tr><td>ypk</td><td>Yu'pik</td></tr><tr><td>zun</td><td>Zuni</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalLanguage</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>tai</td><td>Taino</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalReadingModes</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>x-bra</td><td>Braille</td></tr><tr><td>x-lar</td><td>Large Print</td></tr><tr><td>x-dds</td><td>Digital Documents that Can Be Spoken Out Loud​</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
